  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">WILPF - WPS - SYRIA 2022-2025</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">WILPFs country programme in Syria - Synergies between the media and women activists and feminists for inclusive peace processes and political participation

Stiching female jouralists network (SFJN) aims to further the feminist agenda and amplify the voices of women, particularly those active in public spaces by facilitating and support a more sensitive and inclusive media coverage of peace processes and women&apos;s political participation in Syria where journalists are provided with tailored support, tools and skills and women political actors feel more incouraged to be in the media. SFJN will also produce feminist contextual knowledge, open spaces to share experiences and ideas at regional level and follow its holistic approach to protection.</narrative>
  </description>
